WEBVTT
NOTE OpenIE Research TV — gates (60s) Narrator George

1
00:00:00.488 --> 00:00:04.589
Cheap per-token inference still wastes joules if ten

2
00:00:04.589 --> 00:00:09.084
unverified guesses corrupt state and force human cleanup.

3
00:00:10.084 --> 00:00:16.564
A Mixture of Limits cascade tries deterministic tables and lightweight checks first,

4
00:00:16.564 --> 00:00:19.727
waking heavy models only on novel inputs.

5
00:00:20.727 --> 00:00:31.027
Before any external write commits, a deterministic verifier checks the postcondition, driving Energy-to-Correct-Completion sharply down.

6
00:00:32.027 --> 00:00:38.255
Hardware measurements on the KV260 INA260 rail shunt record

7
00:00:38.255 --> 00:00:44.271
11,428 picojoules per gate cycle across the whole module.

8
00:00:45.271 --> 00:00:49.492
Every software cascade trace and KV260 board log

9
00:00:49.492 --> 00:00:54.768
ships with golden vectors and an interactive FPGA simulator.
